    },
    {
      "title": "打开宝箱·其一",
      "desc": "这些东西，可能有用？",
      "voicefile": "VO_gameplay/VO_razor/vo_razor_chest_open_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/02/e878xszl9hgj7tjsp4az9btg1ndl2uh.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "打开宝箱·其二",
      "desc": "箱子，用完可以，装东西。",
      "voicefile": "VO_gameplay/VO_razor/vo_razor_chest_open_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/72/VO_ZH_Razor_Opening_Treasure_Chest_02.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "打开宝箱·其三",
      "desc": "宝藏的气味。奇怪。",
